msgid "E-Signature"
msgstr "电子签名"

msgid "Two-person"
msgstr "双人"

msgid "Two-Person Electronic Signature Required"
msgstr "需要进行双人电子签名"

msgid "At least one selected batch belongs to a stock item configured to require a two-person electronic signature. Two different operators must each enter their own account and password on this page. The stock is deducted only after both credentials are verified in a single submission."
msgstr "所选批次中至少有一个属于「领用需双人电子签名」的库存。必须由两名不同的操作员在本页各自输入自己的账号和密码；两个凭据在同一次提交中全部校验通过后，才会扣减库存。"

msgid "Allowed roles for the second reviewer:"
msgstr "可担任第二复核人的角色："

msgid "Electronic Signature"
msgstr "电子签名"

msgid "First Operator"
msgstr "第一操作员"

msgid "First Operator Password"
msgstr "第一操作员密码"

msgid "Always the currently logged-in operator who performs the deduction."
msgstr "始终是当前登录的操作员本人，即实际执行扣减的人。"

msgid "Second Reviewer"
msgstr "第二复核人"

msgid "Second Reviewer Password"
msgstr "第二复核人密码"

msgid "Must be a different account from the first operator."
msgstr "必须与第一操作员是不同的账号。"

msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "签名含义"

msgid "What this signature authorizes, for example: consume reagent for a routine test."
msgstr "本次签名所授权的操作，例如：领用试剂用于常规检测。"

msgid "Reason"
msgstr "签名理由"

msgid "Business reason, stored in the signature record and audit trail."
msgstr "业务理由，会写入签名记录与审计追踪。"

msgid "Request Stock Usage"
msgstr "申请领用"

msgid "These items require an approval workflow"
msgstr "所选物品需要审批流程"

msgid "At least one selected batch belongs to a stock item that requires electronic signatures. The stock cannot be consumed directly: a usage request must be raised and signed first, then reviewed and signed by a different person, and only then is the stock deducted."
msgstr "所选批次中至少有一个属于需要电子签名的库存。此类库存不能直接领用：必须先提交领用申请并签名，再由另一位不同的人审核签名，之后才会扣减库存。"

msgid "Approval"
msgstr "审批"

msgid "Required"
msgstr "需审批"

msgid "Usage Request"
msgstr "领用申请"

msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "领用用途"

msgid "Why this stock is requested. The reviewer will see this text together with the requested quantities."
msgstr "申请该库存的原因。审核人会连同申请数量一起看到这段说明。"

msgid "After submitting you will be asked to sign electronically as the applicant. The stock is deducted only after a different person reviews and signs the request."
msgstr "提交后系统会要求你以申请人身份进行电子签名；只有在另一位不同的人审核签名通过后，才会扣减库存。"

