msgid "Please select only one batch: usage requests are reviewed one at a time."
msgstr "请只勾选一个批次：领用申请一次只能审核一条。"

msgid "Submit Request"
msgstr "提交申请"

msgid "At least one selected batch belongs to a stock item that requires approval. The stock cannot be consumed directly: submitting this form raises a usage request that goes to a reviewer. The stock is deducted only after a different person reviews and signs the request."
msgstr "所选批次中至少有一个属于需要审批的库存。此类库存不能直接领用：提交本表单会生成一张领用申请单并送交审核人；只有在另一位不同的人审核签名通过后，才会扣减库存。"

msgid "After submitting, the request goes to the reviewer queue as pending review. The stock is deducted only after a different person reviews and signs it."
msgstr "提交后申请进入待审核队列；只有在另一位不同的人审核签名通过后，才会扣减库存。"

msgid "Usage request submitted for review."
msgstr "领用申请已提交，等待审核。"

msgid "The usage request was created but could not be submitted. Please open it and submit it again."
msgstr "领用申请已创建但未能提交，请打开该申请单点“提交审核”重试。"

